{"id": "DdOafXQx2Q6", "title": "Video by therishikatha", "description": "Every great epic starts with a single word.\n\nDid you know that Lord Ganesha is not just the remover of obstacles, but also the ultimate patron of knowledge and the legendary scribe of the Mahabharata?\n\nAt Rishi Katha Books, we believe in the power of storytelling to spark wisdom and wonder in young minds. Just as Bal Ganesha used his broken tusk to write the greatest epic, we are crafting beautiful stories for the next generation.\n\nWhat is your favorite story or lesson from Lord Ganesha’s life? Let us know in the comments! 👇\n\n#BalGanesha #GaneshChaturthi #IndianMythology #RishiKathaBooks #StoriesForKids #MythologyForKids #SanatanDharma #HinduMythology #KidsBooks #DivineWisdom #Storytelling", "channel": "therishikatha", "uploader_id": "22569163881", "uploader": "Rishi Katha", "timestamp": 1789297582, "like_count": 64, "comment_count": 1, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/145.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1070001929337706a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 48.953, "asr": 32000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMfG4Jmnu1iBy4zo8bAiRKsiUm3aLEzsIpjOJcKOsKmDBshwjeTqIJn_4ZJRJp58_57VQP1g4YONCzjRvGFF31y84mdEOF9K9hzQfg.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_oc=AdoNvKRYkhMOVi72pnr6Wbhhp9ES6dkI-zdHe_x6zouZvelvodnJxlLLqThgzWv6f0Oe4la5yDUSW1pyimWAtDhH&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-2.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=mK3ZiypZ5TkQ7kNvwHySHu9&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=5AhoAfqGsk1bgeldv5tf6A&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQaQwp24Fqs8gpBTv1RzqUYCBWEuhXE6dMzIpWwc3r2NA&oe=6AF41ECE", "manifest_stream_num